getServerSideProps vs getStaticProps?

getServerSideProps fetches data on the server for every request, whereas getStaticProps fetches data during the build 
to generate static pages. I use getServerSideProps when data must be fresh for each request and getStaticProps when the 
content can be generated ahead of time


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
How does Next.js improve SEO and performance

Next.js supports server rendering and static generation, which can deliver meaningful HTML to search engines. 
For performance, I use next/image, code splitting, lazy loading, appropriate caching, and optimized data fetching. 
I also configure page titles and meta descriptions.



